{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 27/09/2024. The use of 343 Hatton Road, TW14 9QS as general open storage of vehicles, material, machinery/equipment and industrial workshop (Use Classes B2, B8, E(g)(i)) was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe application in respect of the use of the site as general open storage of vehicles, material, machinery/equipment and industrial workshop (Use Classes B2, B8, E(g)(i)) at 343 Hatton Road, TW14 9QS would comply with Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act (as amended) and the use would be lawful. The evidence supplied establishes that on the balance of probabilities the use has been in place for an uninterrupted period of at least ten years. \r\n"
  ],
